enshot1.png", "id": "191426200727649", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974606_191426204060982_7564565095945023473_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RXNLwdHNX2MQ7kNvwHeYLdZ&_nc_oc=AdmZ8LBXzQ0e1vLqhvYDgauzvlHvpvOYPnMpJRJLBUXEq1kWorTCdNPcSkRjAE3pX9E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzQ4hgn8zxyFpN4m58_-T_qC8xkYSY226gECKM5kz89Bg&oe=69B2B08F"}, {"file_name": "screenshot2.png", "id": "1095471491907793", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031510_1095471495241126_7904825382140520563_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=41yTXRYrY3cQ7kNvwHakGVP&_nc_oc=Adkv08ApIa5ObUWwalZI8PcoUh9tixiKOYNV4cAfJzP0sb0To9Si5Z2z0RZVuPYKNFQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afyh8HIU36hQtPF4XqAZ58I04iF8mbr8IAxhUaBfq1EZJQ&oe=69B2A23B"}, {"file_name": "screenshot3.png", "id": "1049137639698936", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982554_1049137646365602_1414254081213079555_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pwWvCzuldM4Q7kNvwGMCsrB&_nc_oc=Adlpn4GQBR_dXIFCYeAmUqvvwplTxsVA7mRJ-BJ_XVkoHEhw9XOR4fe9NuMd5OJpWaY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfympmxzwHFVEHpQvmK5KYTGEo2zsixG0_1mnLXH6Xn-YA&oe=69B297FB"}, {"file_name": "screenshot5.png", "id": "1535088327286928", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984462_1535088330620261_2696574789503898695_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=a9mWAo06jsAQ7kNvwGmZGNd&_nc_oc=AdmiesPT4S1CV8Ms5DQJWw2pTp-CP6Zw6bRm_5XaP43k0ln5TR0zNWNq_1wE97dR5ls&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afybg4wHxrMxxpTnBTbn_5Za71cYjpPX64MHym58NH_Dkg&oe=69B2C6DE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440.png", "id": "7050636325025275", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031462_7050636331691941_4735315412487883710_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=csk-xTcObYsQ7kNvwE3tSiX&_nc_oc=AdkP8Y7VPsOh2loruGPq_p5k0nDd_bBIs_1mneEdS915-tR3sVeNgd_q9duCTw6yUCk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyGX5Z1rjczprOtfwWF1XZvF-4mSJF0dz906rgbIeeioQ&oe=69B2A597"}, "display_name": "PlayMaker", "keywords": [], "long_description": "PlayMaker is an innovative VR sports app dedicated to soccer, transforming how teams strategize and collaborate. As a multiplayer platform, it allows users to create, visualize, and share tactical plays in a dynamic mixed-reality environment.\n\nKey Features:\n\nInteractive Strategy Creation: Design and manipulate soccer plays in 3D, offering in-depth tactical understanding.\n\nMixed Reality Meetups: Connect with friends or teammates in a virtual setting, ideal for discussing strategies or socializing.\n\nYouTube Integration: Analyze weekend matches in-app, facilitating group discussions and breakdowns of key game moments.\n\nMeta Avatar Customization: Personalize your meta avatar with team jerseys and accessories, enhancing engagement.\n\nReal-Time Collaboration: Work together in real-time, share ideas, and adjust tactics with teammates or coaches, irrespective of physical location.\n\nEnhanced Communication Tools: Utilize integrated voice chat and gesture recognition for natural, effortless team discussions.\n\nPlayMaker is more than just a tactical tool; it's a bridge between virtual and physical sports training, perfect for soccer teams and enthusiasts eager to leverage technology for an edge in their game.", "short_description": "PlayMaker is an innovative VR sports app dedicated to soccer, transforming how teams strategize and collaborate. As a multiplayer platform, it allows users to create, visualize, and share tactical plays in a dynamic mixed-reality environment."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://rezzil.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Rezzil", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://rezzil.com